  "description": "IYESUE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C58 H72 Gd4 N8 O20,2(C1 H4 O1),4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.599-4.014 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.47-111.94°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C68H92N12O22Gd4.",
